  "title": "Traditional Bakewell Tart",
  "description": "Bakewell tart is a classic British dessert made with shortcrust pastry filled with a layer of jam and sweet almond frangipane. Perfect for afternoon tea!",
  "authors": [
    "Trishie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2017-09-29T09:00:47-04:00",
