  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 pound pie crust pastry",
    "7 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "3 tablespoons ground almonds",
    "0.25 teaspoon baking powder",
    "2 tablespoons strawberry jam",
    "1 large egg",
    "0.25 teaspoon lemon zest",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "0.25 cup superfine sugar",
    "1/2 cup sliced almonds",
    "1 teaspoon confectioners' sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease an 8-inch pie plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WnK04ZbQdU2cLfQPCJemMKVCBwU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-01-996f2038d01d485ba27c37ce0ac0e600.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the bottom and sides of prepared pie plate with pastry; trim any excess pastry if needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fGo2nLyyXzI2YCFADUjuRlawLRo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-02-84a49768939a4b17b5fb29935b07701b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frangipane: Whisk flour, ground almonds, and baking powder together in a medium bowl. Whisk egg and lemon zest together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wLTiOM9_hupsS-SJ7t0MnCyDD5s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-03-5542046c2c15462a80d8460844e9a160.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and sugar with an electric mixer in a bowl until light and fluffy. Gradually add egg mixture, beating well after each addition. Gently fold in flour mixture, a spoonful at a time, until just incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I_O8Nl-5mQNpNjp7k1h7sOI-N2U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-04-af2435bc2de84e1f9cac2ec981658c54.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread raspberry jam evenly over bottom of pastry shell to form a layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bUGzNqmDSYauP_xwyy3Tvy3MP90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-05-02-d1a3cd305bf0444c927fef28c689fbca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread frangipane evenly on top. Scatter sliced almonds on top if using.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4Bf3DNc1Xigk5jLkCsp_M2KEp6g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-06-2ef643dd4e9c498d880bc5f1425bb7d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until filling is firmly set and browned, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/riWxA4WTuu3PvLKizo2vU8Q_NGs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-07-fcb75068b8594b3e8f2eb5f3e049b262.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle with confectioners' sugar just before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NrIhmURv-9kuLUO_O84KrQ7OxTQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-164877-traditional-bakewell-tart-VAT-step-08-02-6a3ba37b37cf4c15a4950b9fe9fca8ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/164877/step_08.webp"
    }
